      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "First choose a sound in the Main Input panel on the left, under Audio: a microphone, a Sound file, or System audio (what you hear). The Main Input's Bass is a number from 0 to 1; the Reframe Range turns it into a Radius from 0.4 to 0.95, so silence is a small hexagon and a kick swells it. Try Out Max higher for a bigger punch, or cable Mid or High in place of Bass."
        }
      },
